#: src\operations/overview.md:42
msgid ""
"[kanade-agent itself](./agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md) — the agent "
"self-update path (different from the other three; it uses a dedicated "
"rollout bucket, not the generic OBJECT_APP_PACKAGES + script pair)"
msgstr ""
